          }
        }
      }
    },
    "?! inaccuracy · ? mistake · ?? blunder; estimates may change.": {
      "comment": "The move grades' glyphs and what they mean",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "?! 不精确 · ? 失误 · ?? 严重失误；评估结果可能变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bishop slides diagonally and stays on squares of one color. It cannot pass through pieces.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "象沿斜线移动，始终停留在同一种颜色的格子上，不能越过其他棋子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A board pattern held back for fresh practice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "留作全新练习的棋盘局面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A check, capture, promotion or the final move": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将军、吃子、升变或最后一步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few puzzles to look at again and a few new ones. Play it whenever you like.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "几道待回顾的习题，加上几道新题。随时可以练习。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A finished attempt cannot be resumed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已结束的尝试无法继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game you review is saved here when you return to your game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回当前对局时，你复盘的对局会保存在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A hint is unavailable (%@). Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示暂不可用（%@）。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A hint is unavailable. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示暂不可用。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A king steps one square in any direction, and never onto a square an enemy piece attacks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "王可以向任意方向走一格，但不能走到对方棋子攻击的格子上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A knight jumps in an L: two squares one way and one square sideways. It hops over pieces.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "马走L形：先沿一个方向走两格，再向侧面走一格。马可以越过其他棋子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A legal reply is %@. Compare what happens after the capture before calling the piece safe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一种合法应对是%@。判断棋子是否安全前，请比较吃子后的变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A lesson recording is running. Completed text and clips are kept; the item in progress, already charged, is lost. Record / Resume continues later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在录制课程。已完成的文本和音频片段会保留；正在处理且已计费的项目将丢失。之后可通过“录制 / 继续”接着处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A lesson translation is running. Completed text and clips are kept; the item in progress, already charged, is lost. Record / Resume continues later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在翻译课程。已完成的文本和音频片段会保留；正在处理且已计费的项目将丢失。之后可通过“录制 / 继续”接着处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A lesson uses the selected language after all its recordings are complete. Otherwise, the whole lesson plays in English.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "课程的所有录音完成后，才会使用所选语言。否则，整节课程将以英语播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A library game's position": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库中某局对局的局面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A listener is not on loopback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有一个监听器未绑定到回环地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A malformed network message.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络消息格式错误。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A malformed network message: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络消息格式错误：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A message could not be sent: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法发送消息：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A message went to %@, which the runner does not hold. Effects: %@; held: %@; last event: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A message went to %1$@, which the runner does not hold. Effects: %2$@; held: %3$@; last event: %4$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消息发送到了%1$@，但运行器并未持有它。效果：%2$@；已持有：%3$@；最后事件：%4$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A move cannot be shown right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前无法显示走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A network message of %lld bytes is over the %lld-byte limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A network message of %1$lld bytes is over the %2$lld-byte limit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络消息大小为%1$lld字节，超过了%2$lld字节的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new game could not be started (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法开始新对局（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new game could not be started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法开始新对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A part of the app could not be opened. Reinstall Checkmate if this continues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开应用的某个组件。如果问题持续，请重新安装Checkmate。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pawn can promote only to a queen, rook, bishop or knight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兵只能升变为后、车、象或马。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pawn moves straight forward one square, or two from its starting square, and captures only one square diagonally forward.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兵向正前方走一格，在起始格上可以走两格；吃子时只能向斜前方走一格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pawn race needs its pawn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兵的竞速练习必须包含指定的兵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A position could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取局面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A position game names its goal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "局面对局需指定目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A preview line: it is not kept unless you play a move in it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是预览变化；只有在其中走一步棋后才会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A queen slides like a rook or a bishop. It cannot pass through pieces.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后可以像车或象一样移动，不能越过其他棋子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A review could not be saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存复盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rook slides along ranks and files. It cannot pass through pieces.": {
      "localizations": {
