          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "走 %1$@ 之前，引擎的首选是 %2$@。这次简短搜索的结果仅供参考；请比较后续合法应着，不要将其视为定论。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before any other move, look at every check you can give: one of them may end the game.": {
