    "Bundled English narration uses OpenAI Cedar. Generated lesson recordings use your selected voice and are AI-generated. Continue automatically plays the next transcript and starts the next lesson when this one ends, skipping practice activities. Pause for practice stops at the end of a lesson that has a game or practice activity so you can try it before continuing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内置英文讲解使用 OpenAI Cedar。生成的课程录音使用你选择的声音，由 AI 生成。“自动继续”会自动播放下一段讲稿，并在本课结束后开始下一课，跳过练习活动。“暂停以练习”会在包含对局或练习活动的课程结束时暂停，让你先尝试，再继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
