    "Cannot recapture after %@ on %@ plays %@; that recapture would leave its own king in check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Cannot recapture after %1$@ on %2$@ plays %3$@; that recapture would leave its own king in check."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@（位于 %2$@）走 %3$@ 后无法回吃；回吃会使己方王被将军。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Capture the attacker": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "吃掉攻击棋子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Capture, check or promotion": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "吃子、将军或升变"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Captures are checked with the attacking side to move. Solid lines indicate a legal capture; dashed lines show geometric attacks restricted by king safety. This does not predict the opponent’s choice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "吃子是否合法按攻击方走棋时的局面检查。实线表示合法吃子；虚线表示按棋子走法形成的攻击，但因王的安全而无法执行。这并不预测对手的选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Castling": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "王车易位"
          }
