          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose File ▸ Review Current Game (⇧⌘R) to go through a game move by move, or File ▸ Open… (⌘O) to review a PGN or FEN file. You can try your own moves without changing the original game, then save the review (⌘S) or export it (⇧⌘E). Edit ▸ Copy FEN and Copy PGN copy the position or the game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择“文件 ▸ 复盘当前对局”（⇧⌘R）逐步回顾对局，或选择“文件 ▸ 打开…”（⌘O）复盘 PGN 或 FEN 文件。你可以尝试自己的着法，而不改变原始对局，然后保存复盘（⌘S）或导出（⇧⌘E）。“编辑 ▸ 复制 FEN”和“复制 PGN”可分别复制局面或对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a PGN file to add to My games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择要添加到“我的对局”的 PGN 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a file to review": {
      "localizations": {
