          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dots show potential movement with current blockers. It is not this side’s turn; checks and pins may restrict these moves. Rings show attacks or defended squares.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圆点表示考虑当前棋子阻挡后的潜在走法。当前并非该方回合；将军和牵制可能限制这些走法。圆环表示攻击或防守的格子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dots show the opponent’s possible moves. You play %@.": {
