    "Follow each Black piece's lines and jumps. A line stops at the first piece in the way; a pinned piece still attacks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐一查看黑方棋子的行棋线路和跳跃落点。线路在遇到第一枚棋子时停止；被牵制的棋子仍具有攻击力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow each White piece's lines and jumps. A line stops at the first piece in the way; a pinned piece still attacks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐一查看白方棋子的行棋线路和跳跃落点。线路在遇到第一枚棋子时停止；被牵制的棋子仍具有攻击力。"
          }
