    "Left and Right arrows step through the line shown, an imagined one too. Up and Down arrows switch between other moves played from the same position. Home and End go to the line's start and end. Hold Option with the arrow keys to explore squares, then press Return to choose a piece or destination. Escape clears your selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左右方向键可逐步浏览当前显示的线路，包括推演线路。上下方向键可切换同一局面的其他走法。Home 和 End 可跳转到线路的起点和终点。按住 Option 并使用方向键可浏览棋格，然后按 Return 选择棋子或目标格。Escape 可清除选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
