        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not quite. Is the king under attack, and does the side to move have a legal move?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还不对。王是否受到攻击？轮到走棋的一方是否有合法走法？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not quite. Look again and try another answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还不对。再看看，试试其他答案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not quite. Look again: %@.": {
      "comment": "The right answers, separated by semicolons",
