    "Pawns move forward and capture diagonally. A pawn on its starting rank may advance two empty squares.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兵向前走，斜向吃子。位于起始横线的兵可以向前走两格，前提是这两格都没有棋子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picture the piece moving: count each square it can reach in one move, and stop at any piece in the way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "想象这枚棋子的走法：数出它一步能到达的每个格子，遇到挡路的棋子就停下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picture where the piece could capture: those are the squares it attacks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "想象这枚棋子能在哪些格子吃子：那些就是它攻击的格子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
