    "Play a Game": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始对局"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play a game against Stockfish, which runs on this Mac and works offline. Choose Game ▸ New Game… (⌘N) to pick your side and the opponent's strength. Game ▸ Hint (⇧⌘H) suggests a move, and Protected by (⇧⌘P) and Attacked by (⇧⌘A) show how a piece is defended or threatened. To play from the keyboard, choose Game ▸ Type a Move… (⌘L) and type a move such as e4, Nf3 or O-O. Click a move in the move list to see that earlier position, and use the left and right arrow keys to step through the moves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与在此 Mac 上运行的 Stockfish 对弈，无需联网。选择“对局 ▸ 新建对局…”(⌘N)，设置执棋方和对手强度。“对局 ▸ 提示”(⇧⌘H) 可推荐走法，“保护者”(⇧⌘P) 和“攻击者”(⇧⌘A) 可显示棋子受到哪些棋子的保护或攻击。要用键盘走棋，请选择“对局 ▸ 输入走法…”(⌘L)，输入 e4、Nf3 或 O-O 等走法。点按走法列表中的一步可查看当时的局面，使用左右方向键可逐步浏览走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play a game against someone on your local network, or watch one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与本地网络中的其他人对弈，或观看对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play a move to review your current game. You can also drop a PGN file on the window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先走一步，即可复盘当前对局。你也可以将 PGN 文件拖放到窗口中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
