    "Stalemate: Black has no legal move, but the king is not in check, so the game is a draw. Undo your last move and leave the king a square.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逼和：黑方无合法着法，但王未被将军，因此本局和棋。悔棋一步，给对方的王留一个可走的格子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stalemate: the defender has no legal move and is not in check, so the game is a draw. Leave the king a square while you close in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逼和：防守方无合法着法，且未被将军，因此本局和棋。逼近时要给对方的王留一个可走的格子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stalemate: the side to move has no legal move but is not in check. The game is a draw.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逼和：轮到走棋的一方无合法着法，但未被将军。本局和棋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stalemate: you have no legal move and are not in check, so the game is a draw.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逼和：你无合法着法，且未被将军，因此本局和棋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stalemate: your opponent has no legal move and is not in check, so the game is a draw.": {
