      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋合法，但不是王车易位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That move is legal, but it leaves the idea of this exercise. Undo it and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋合法，但偏离了本练习的思路。请悔棋后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That move is legal, but it misses the follow-up. Undo it and look again, or ask for a hint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋合法，但错过了后续手段。请悔棋后再看看，或请求提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
