      }
    },
    "That move is not castling. To castle, move the king two squares toward a rook.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋不是王车易位。要进行王车易位，请将王朝车的方向移动两格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That move is not legal here, so it was not counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋在当前局面不合法，因此未计入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That move is not legal here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋在当前局面不合法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That move is not possible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋无法走出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That move isn't legal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋不合法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That move would leave your king in check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋会让你的王仍处于被将军状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That move would put your own king in check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这步棋会让己方的王受到将军。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That piece has no legal move here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个棋子在当前局面没有合法走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That position can't start a game. Choose a different move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法从该局面开始对局。请选择其他走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That position is already over. Choose a different move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该局面已结束。请选择其他走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That square holds your own piece.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该格有己方棋子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That square is %@, not %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "That square is %1$@, not %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该格是 %1$@，不是 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That square is not a safe neighboring square. Try another step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该格不是安全的相邻格。请尝试其他走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That was today’s mix. Well played!": {
      "comment": "Heading at the end of Today’s Mix",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日综合练习已完成。下得不错！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ listener failed: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The %1$@ listener failed: %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 监听器出错：%2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Codex app from OpenAI, installed on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装在这台 Mac 上的 OpenAI Codex App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Codex companion accepts connections only from this Mac. A Codex task you connect can read the current game, its position and moves, and your saved reviews, including the names, events and comments in imported games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 助手仅接受来自这台 Mac 的连接。连接的 Codex 任务可以读取当前对局、局面和走法，以及已保存的复盘，包括导入对局中的姓名、赛事和评注。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Codex companion is a Codex task on this Mac that can see your board, coach you, or play against you, using Checkmate’s chess tools. Set Up Codex adds Checkmate to Codex once; after that, Checkmate waits on this Mac for a Codex task to connect. While the voice coach is connected, Codex is asked to wait; disconnect voice to use the companion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 助手是在这台 Mac 上运行的 Codex 任务，可使用 Checkmate 的国际象棋工具查看棋盘、指导你或与你对弈。通过“设置 Codex”将 Checkmate 添加到 Codex 一次后，Checkmate 就会在这台 Mac 上等待 Codex 任务连接。语音教练连接期间，Codex 会被要求等待；要使用助手，请先断开语音连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The account could not generate this recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该账户无法生成这段录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analysis found no mistakes or blunders in this game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析未发现本局有错误或严重失误。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer is %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答案是 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer is None.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答案是“无”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer is: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答案是：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer was shown last time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次已显示答案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistance stays the same for the whole game, and each Mac counts the hints its player uses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整局对局的辅助设置保持不变，每台 Mac 会统计其玩家使用的提示次数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The authored opening does not match the position at node %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编写的开局与节点 %lld 的局面不匹配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The best line could not be shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法显示最佳变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The best reply, %@, does not change that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最佳应对 %@ 也无法改变这一点。"
