        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑正在思考"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The computer is thinking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑正在思考…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The computer played %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑走了 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The computer's reply did not fit this position. Press Resume to try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑的应对走法不适用于当前局面。请点按“继续”重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The context moves must show how the pawn arrived.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前序走法必须体现该兵如何到达当前位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The costliest move was %@. Start there: compare it with the engine's choice.": {
      "comment": "The game overview when the analysis found one costly move, with its grade, as in: 12. Nf3 (blunder)",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "损失最大的一步是 %@。从这里开始，将它与引擎的选择进行比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The costliest moves were %@. Start with %@: compare it with the engine's choice.": {
      "comment": "The game overview: two or three costly moves, each with its grade, then the costliest one again",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The costliest moves were %1$@. Start with %2$@: compare it with the engine's choice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "损失最大的几步是 %1$@。先看 %2$@，将它与引擎的选择进行比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current progress is too large to keep before importing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前进度过大，无法在导入前保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The data folder is not a folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据文件夹路径指向的不是文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The data folder may be full or read-only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据文件夹可能已满或为只读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The defender captured %@. Keep it protected, or out of the king's reach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防守方吃掉了 %@。请保护好它，或让它远离对方王的攻击范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The defender is Stockfish at full strength with a short think: it resists well, but it is not perfect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防守方使用全力运行但思考时间较短的 Stockfish：防守能力很强，但并非完美。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The defender is thinking": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防守方正在思考"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The defender played %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防守方走了 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The defender's reply could not be checked, so the game is paused. Nothing is counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证防守方的应对走法，对局已暂停。本次不计入统计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The deleted review could not be put back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法恢复已删除的复盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine has no move to show here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎在此没有可显示的走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine prefers %@ by approximately %@ pawns in this short search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The engine prefers %1$@ by approximately %2$@ pawns in this short search."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本次短时搜索中，引擎更倾向于 %1$@，评分约高出 %2$@ 个兵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine prefers another move by approximately %@ pawns in this short search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本次短时搜索中，引擎更倾向于另一走法，评分约高出 %@ 个兵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine's choice here is %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎在此选择 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine's leading option is %@. It is a provisional suggestion from a short search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎的首选走法是 %@。这是短时搜索给出的暂定建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine's leading option is %@. It remained the leading option in the deeper search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎的首选走法是 %@。在更深入的搜索中，它仍是首选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The exchange could not be resolved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法完成此次交换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The export could not be written. Choose another location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法写入导出文件。请选择其他位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fifty-move draw can be claimed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以依据五十回合规则申请和棋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file has more than %lld games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件包含超过 %lld 局对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file has more than %lld games; split it into smaller files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
