            "value": "该文件包含超过 %lld 局对局；请将其拆分为较小的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件为空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is not readable text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件不是可读取的文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The final Black king has no legal answer to check. Replay the last moves to see how its escape squares disappeared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最终局面中，黑方无法合法应将。回放最后几步，看看黑王的逃脱格是如何被封住的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The final White king has no legal answer to check. Replay the last moves to see how its escape squares disappeared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最终局面中，白方无法合法应将。回放最后几步，看看白王的逃脱格是如何被封住的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The final position is stalemate. When ahead, leave the opposing king a legal move unless your move gives checkmate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最终局面是逼和。占优时，除非能将死，否则要给对方的王留出合法走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game could not be exported. Choose another location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法导出对局。请选择其他位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game could not be set up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法设置对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game could not open its listeners: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法启动对局监听器：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is drawn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对局和棋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is drawn: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对局和棋：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is ordinary chess from this position: checkmate wins, and stalemate is a draw. Training goals stay in Training.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从此局面开始，按标准国际象棋规则对弈：将死获胜，逼和则和棋。训练目标仅适用于“训练”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对局已结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is over. Start a new game to play again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对局已结束。请开始新对局以继续下棋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is played by the mini-game's own rules, with no assistance. Review afterwards shows what a proof search found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对局按小游戏自身的规则进行，不提供辅助。结束后可通过复盘查看证明搜索的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is recorded as a loss. Start a new game or review it afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本局记为负。你可以开始新对局，或稍后复盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library could not be loaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法加载棋谱库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取棋谱库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library event %@ is invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库事件 %@ 无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library file %@ has bytes outside its records.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库文件 %@ 含有记录范围之外的字节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library file %@ is missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库文件 %@ 缺失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library folder holds PGN files the manifest does not account for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库文件夹中存在清单未收录的 PGN 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library is full (%lld MiB). Remove a collection first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库已满（%lld MiB）。请先移除一个合集。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library is full, so this collection's index could not be rebuilt. Remove a collection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库已满，无法重建此合集的索引。请移除一个合集。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library is not loaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库尚未加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library manifest could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取棋谱库清单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library manifest does not account for every game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库清单未收录所有对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game library manifest is invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库清单无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game moved on. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对局已有新进展。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game record could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取对局记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game record could not be written.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法写入对局记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game record is over the snapshot limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对局记录超过快照大小限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game waits until both players are here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待双方玩家就位后开始对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highlighted piece can give checkmate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高亮显示的棋子可以将死对方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highlighted piece is giving check: move away, block the line, or capture it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高亮显示的棋子正在将军：请移王、挡将或吃掉它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host sent a message that breaks the protocol (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机发送了违反协议的消息（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installed companion skill is from an older Checkmate. Choose Set Up Codex to update it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装的助手技能来自旧版 Checkmate。请选择“设置 Codex”进行更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The instruction describes the starting position; your game stays as it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说明描述的是起始局面；你的对局保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The job could not finish. Completed work is preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务未能完成。已完成的工作已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king and rook moved together when castling.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "王车易位时，王和车在同一步中移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king can escape to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "王可以逃到 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king may not castle out of check, through an attacked square or into check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "王被将军时不能王车易位，也不能在易位时经过或到达受攻击的格子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king never counts here: it can never be captured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里不计入王：王永远不能被吃掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king to move is attacked right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前行棋方的王正受到攻击。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king to move is not attacked right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前行棋方的王未受到攻击。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language or voice changed while it ran; its results are kept for the earlier choice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行期间语言或声音已更改；结果按先前的选择保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language pack directory is unsafe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语言包目录不安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lesson cache is too large to inspect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "课程缓存过大，无法检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lesson cache is too large to inspect. Remove recordings explicitly to continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "课程缓存过大，无法检查。请手动移除录音后继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lesson illustration could not load.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法加载课程插图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library could not be locked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法锁定资料库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library could not be written.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法写入资料库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library folder could not be flushed to disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将资料库文件夹同步写入磁盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library game %@ could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取棋谱库中的对局 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library game %@ does not hold exactly one game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库中的对局 %@ 未包含恰好一局对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library game %@ has an invalid manifest entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库中的对局 %@ 的清单条目无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library game %@ is damaged: its record does not match the library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库中的对局 %@ 已损坏：其记录与棋谱库不匹配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library game %@ lies outside its file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋谱库中的对局 %@ 的数据范围超出所在文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The live voice service is having trouble right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时语音服务目前出现问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The live voice service stopped this session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时语音服务已终止本次会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The live voice service turned down this connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时语音服务拒绝了此次连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The low-time warning could not play.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法播放剩余时间不足警告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The marked square must hold an enemy pawn on the en-passant rank.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标记格必须位于可吃过路兵的横线上，且有对方的兵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The measured continuations differ in whether the engine finds forced mate. Replay both lines; this is a search result, not proof of the game outcome.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在评估的后续变化中，引擎找到强制将死的情况不同。请回放两条变化；这是搜索结果，并不能证明对局结局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mini-game's history was cut short.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小游戏的历史记录被截断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The move could not be taken back (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法悔棋（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The move could not be taken back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法悔棋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The moves of this attempt are cleared. Anything you have already achieved in it stays achieved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次尝试的走法已清除。已达成的成果仍会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network game you were watching ended when Checkmate closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你观看的联网对局已随 Checkmate 关闭而结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network game's rules failed: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "联网对局的规则处理出错：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next position could not be shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法显示下一个局面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The operation was canceled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The opponent played %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对手走了 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The opponent's king is in check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方的王正被将军。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other Mac uses Checkmate network protocol %@; this one uses %@. Update Checkmate on both Macs to play together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The other Mac uses Checkmate network protocol %1$@; this one uses %2$@. Update Checkmate on both Macs to play together."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一台 Mac 使用 Checkmate 网络协议 %1$@，本机使用 %2$@。请更新两台 Mac 上的 Checkmate 后再一起下棋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pawn became %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兵升变为 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pawn on %@ controls %@. Another piece needs a legal route to use those squares; this does not establish why the pawn was moved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The pawn on %1$@ controls %2$@. Another piece needs a legal route to use those squares; this does not establish why the pawn was moved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 上的兵控制着 %2$@。其他棋子需要有合法路径才能利用这些格子；这并不能说明当时为什么移动该兵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The piece can no longer reach %@ from here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该棋子已无法从这里到达 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The piece inspector is not available in a mini-game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小游戏中无法使用棋子检查器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The piece on %@ is covered by an opposing piece from %@. This is an attack map, not proof that a capture wins material.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The piece on %1$@ is covered by an opposing piece from %2$@. This is an attack map, not proof that a capture wins material."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 上的棋子受到来自 %2$@ 的对方棋子攻击。这是攻击关系图，并不代表吃子就能获得子力优势。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The played move is close to the leading alternative at the recorded search budgets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在记录的搜索资源限制下，实战走法与首选替代走法的评价接近。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The position changed; try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "局面已改变；请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The position has no six-field FEN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该局面没有包含六个字段的 FEN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The position is checkmate; there is no legal continuation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该局面已将死，没有合法的后续走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The practice defender is not available. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "练习防守方不可用。请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The practice defender returned a move that is not legal here, so the game is paused. Nothing is counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "练习防守方返回了当前局面不合法的走法，对局已暂停。本次不计入统计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The practice defender stopped responding, so the game is paused. Nothing is counted; try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
