        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译响应过大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unfinished exercise could not be recorded: %@": {
      "comment": "The value is the reason, a whole sentence",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法记录未完成的练习：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unreadable history file is kept, and a new history starts with this session’s activity. Your lessons, recordings and progress are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取的历史文件已保留，并将从本次会话的活动开始创建新的历史记录。你的课程、录音和进度均已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice coach available to your account cannot think at the level you chose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的账户可用的语音教练无法使用所选思考级别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice coach cannot connect to what is shown now. Return to Practice or a training game you are playing to connect it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音教练无法连接当前显示的内容。请返回“练习”或正在进行的训练对局后连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice coach connects only to a training game being played.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音教练只能连接正在进行的训练对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice coach could not connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音教练无法连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice coach is off until you choose Connect Voice Coach in the Game menu. The first time, Checkmate explains what is sent to OpenAI and asks before it connects. Game ▸ Stop Speaking (⌘.) stops the coach at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在“对局”菜单中选择“连接语音教练”后，语音教练才会启用。首次连接时，Checkmate 会说明发送给 OpenAI 的内容，并征求你的同意。随时可通过“对局 ▸ 停止朗读”（⌘.）让教练停止说话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice coach is optional. It can talk with you about your moves while you practice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音教练是可选功能，可以在练习时与你讨论走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice coach needs the Codex app, signed in with your ChatGPT account. Settings › Voice Coach shows what you need.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音教练需要安装 Codex App，并使用你的 ChatGPT 账户登录。“设置 › 语音教练”会显示所需条件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice coach needs your agreement to what it sends to OpenAI before it connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接语音教练前，需要你同意其发送给 OpenAI 的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice coach stopped answering.": {
