        }
      }
    },
    "This removes cached translated text and its recordings for the chosen scope, so Translate can request fresh text. Your progress and bundled English lessons are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会移除所选范围内缓存的译文及其录音，以便通过“翻译”获取新译文。你的进度和内置英语课程会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes completed Checkmate usage history. Activity still running remains recorded. Your lessons, recordings and progress are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会移除 Checkmate 中已完成活动的使用历史。仍在进行的活动会继续保留记录。你的课程、录音和进度会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes one recording for the selected language, voice and lesson. Record / Resume then records only that clip again; until then the lesson plays in English.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会移除所选语言、声音和课程的一段录音。之后选择“录制 / 继续录制”时，只会重新录制该片段；在此之前，课程将以英语播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes recordings for the selected language, voice and scope. Translated text, progress and bundled English lessons are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会移除所选语言、声音和范围内的录音。译文、进度和内置英语课程会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the saved review and its imagined lines; Edit ▸ Undo puts them back. Your current game and the original imported file are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会移除已保存的复盘及其推演变化；选择“编辑 ▸ 撤销”可恢复。当前对弈和原始导入文件会保留。"
          }
