          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "译文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translated text stored, but this voice's stored recordings are damaged or out of date. Choose Remove Stored Lesson, then Record / Resume; the translated text is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "译文已保存，但此声音的已存录音已损坏或过期。请选择“移除已存课程”，然后选择“录制 / 继续录制”；译文会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translated text stored; %lld of %lld recordings stored. Incomplete lessons use English.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Translated text stored; %1$lld of %2$lld recordings stored. Incomplete lessons use English."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "译文已保存；已保存 %1$lld 段录音，总计 %2$lld 段。录音不完整的课程使用英语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translating a lesson sends its text to Codex, and recording it sends the translated text to OpenAI for speech. Both happen only when you choose them, using your Codex sign-in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译课程会将课程文本发送给 Codex，录制则会将译文发送给 OpenAI 以生成语音。这两项操作仅在你主动选择时进行，并使用你的 Codex 登录授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation and recordings discarded. Translate explicitly to create a replacement.": {
