            "value": "显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View ▸ Show Sidebar (⌃⌘S) and Show Details (⌥⌘I) open the drawers beside the board. Closing the window quits Checkmate, after the same questions Quit asks, because the board is the app's only window. Settings (⌘,) holds the board, sound, lessons, practice, voice and connection choices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“显示 ▸ 显示边栏”(⌃⌘S) 和“显示详细信息”(⌥⌘I) 可打开棋盘旁的面板。棋盘是应用唯一的窗口，因此关闭窗口会退出 Checkmate，并显示与“退出”相同的确认问题。“设置”(⌘,) 中包含棋盘、声音、课程、练习、语音和连接选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
