    "Voice coach language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音教练语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice coaching is off during your network game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络对弈期间，语音指导已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice coaching is off during your network game. The coach can connect once the game ends.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络对弈期间，语音指导已关闭。对弈结束后即可连接教练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice is off until you connect it and agree to what is sent to OpenAI. After that, if this is on, Checkmate checks once at launch whether your Codex sign-in can use voice, and connects only when your account allows it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接语音并同意向 OpenAI 发送相关内容之前，语音保持关闭。此后，若开启此选项，Checkmate 会在每次启动时检查一次你的 Codex 登录是否支持语音，并仅在账户允许时连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice is unavailable while Codex is connected to Checkmate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 连接到 Checkmate 时，语音不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice needs the Codex app, and it is not on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音需要 Codex 应用，但此 Mac 上尚未安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice subscription quota attribution is unknown. Actual charges are not reported here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音用量计入哪项订阅配额尚不明确。此处不显示实际费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for the current job to finish, or cancel it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请等待当前任务完成，或将其取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for the defender's reply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请等待防守方应着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for the opponent’s move, then play this move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请等待对手走棋后，再走这一步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for the voice preview to finish before connecting the voice coach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请等待语音预览结束后，再连接语音教练。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait until the coach finishes speaking, then preview.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请等待教练说完后再试听。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for Local Network access…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待本地网络访问权限…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a Codex task to connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待 Codex 任务连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for someone to join. Share the play code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待他人加入。请分享对弈代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for you to confirm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待你确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walk safely from %@ to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Walk safely from %1$@ to %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 %1$@ 安全走到 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walnut": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "胡桃木"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观战"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观战代码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch code, %@": {
      "comment": "The watch code, read one character at a time",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观战代码，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watching %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在观看 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Checkmate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Checkmate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Well done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "做得好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Well done!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "做得好！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What You Need": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所需条件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's inside": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内容概览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whatever you choose, that file is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无论你如何选择，该文件都会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When castling is not allowed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哪些情况下不能王车易位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When en passant is not allowed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哪些情况下不能吃过路兵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the voice coach is connected, what you say and the current position are sent to OpenAI, authorized by your Codex sign-in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接语音教练后，你说的话和当前局面会通过你的 Codex 登录授权发送给 OpenAI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this is on, Checkmate asks GitHub for the latest release each time it opens. Checkmate ▸ Check for Updates… asks at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，Checkmate 会在每次打开时向 GitHub 查询最新版本。你也可以随时选择“Checkmate ▸ 检查更新…”进行查询。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where echo cancellation is available, speak to interrupt the coach; otherwise the microphone pauses while the coach speaks. Assisted moves require your spoken request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持回声消除时，你可以开口打断教练；否则，教练说话时麦克风会暂停。辅助走棋需要你口头提出请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where to start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从哪里开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where would you like to start?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想从哪里开始？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which check leaves the king no square, no block and no capture?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哪一步将军能让对方既无法移王，也无法垫子或吃掉将军的棋子？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which of your opponent's checks would be mate?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对手的哪一步将军会构成将死？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which other Black pieces attack %@? Follow their lines and jumps; a line stops at the first piece in the way. A pinned piece or a king still counts as protecting here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还有哪些黑方棋子攻击 %@？沿着它们的攻击线路和跳跃走法查看；线路遇到第一个棋子就停止。在这里，被牵制的棋子或王仍算作提供保护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which other White pieces attack %@? Follow their lines and jumps; a line stops at the first piece in the way. A pinned piece or a king still counts as protecting here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还有哪些白方棋子攻击 %@？沿着它们的攻击线路和跳跃走法查看；线路遇到第一个棋子就停止。在这里，被牵制的棋子或王仍算作提供保护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "白方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "White bishop": {
      "comment": "A piece by side and kind, opening a label, as in: White bishop on c4",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "白方象"
          }
        }
      }
    },
