    },
    "World Championships": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "世界冠军赛"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worth reviewing: %@ on %@ can be taken. Is it protected well enough?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Worth reviewing: %1$@ on %2$@ can be taken. Is it protected well enough?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "值得复盘：%1$@位于 %2$@，可能被吃掉。它受到的保护足够吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worth reviewing: early in the game, bringing out knights and bishops before the queen usually helps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "值得复盘：开局阶段，先出马和象，再出后，通常更有利。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worth reviewing: your king can no longer castle. Castling is often the quickest way to a safe king.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "值得复盘：你的王已无法王车易位。王车易位通常是保障王安全的最快方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes, castling is allowed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是，可以王车易位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes, en passant is allowed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是，可以吃过路兵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
