            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取你的收藏集。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your companion skill differs from this version’s and is kept as it is. To use this version’s, remove ~/.codex/skills/%@, then choose Set Up Codex.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的配套技能与此版本的不同，已原样保留。要使用此版本的技能，请移除 ~/.codex/skills/%@，然后选择“设置 Codex”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your current game will be available under Restore Previous Game, replacing the game kept there now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前对局将保存在“恢复上一局”中，并替换那里现有的对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your current game will be available under Restore Previous Game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前对局将保存在“恢复上一局”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your current practice game is kept as your previous game, so you can still review it. Only one previous game is kept, so the one kept before is replaced. The game you are reviewing stays unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前练习对局将保存为上一局，供你继续复盘。由于只保留一局，此前保存的对局将被替换。你正在复盘的对局保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your customized companion skill was kept.": {
      "localizations": {
