        }
      }
    },
    "Your idea · move %lld of %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Your idea · move %1$lld of %2$lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的思路 · 第 %1$lld 步，共 %2$lld 步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your king is in check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的王正被将军。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your king or rook has moved, so White can no longer castle in this game. Undo your moves or start again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的王或车已经移动过，白方在本局中无法再进行王车易位。请撤销走棋或重新开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your king would be attacked on %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的王在 %@ 会受到攻击。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your latest progress could not be saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存你的最新进度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your move": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的走法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your move is close to the engine’s first choice in this short search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的走法接近引擎在本次短时搜索中的首选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your move is on its way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在发送你的走法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your move matches the engine’s first choice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的走法与引擎的首选一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轮到你走棋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your network game with %@ ended when Checkmate closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checkmate 关闭时，你与 %@ 的联机对局已结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your opponent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的对手"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your opponent is Gentle: Stockfish choosing among reasonable moves, so it makes real mistakes but rarely throws the game away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的对手为温和级：Stockfish 会在合理走法中选择，因此会出现真实的失误，但很少轻易葬送对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your opponent is Steady: Stockfish at a low skill level. It plays real chess but makes mistakes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的对手为稳健级：Stockfish 使用较低棋力。它会正常下棋，但也会犯错。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your opponent is Stockfish at a low skill level: it plays real chess but makes mistakes. Notes on your moves are things worth reviewing, not wrong answers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的对手是较低棋力的 Stockfish：它会正常下棋，但也会犯错。对你走法的点评指出的是值得复盘的地方，并非判定你的答案错误。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your opponent is Strong: Stockfish at full strength with a short think. It resists well, but it is not perfect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的对手为强劲级：Stockfish 以完整棋力进行短时思考。它的应对很顽强，但并非完美无缺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your opponent threatens checkmate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对手正威胁将死"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your progress could not be saved. Export it before quitting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存你的进度。请在退出前导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your progress is unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的进度未变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your saved attempt could not be replayed, so the exercise starts again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法重现已保存的作答，本练习将重新开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your saved attempt was made by a newer version of Checkmate, so it starts again here. Your first move or hint replaces it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存的作答来自较新版本的 Checkmate，因此本次将重新开始。你首次走棋或使用提示时，将替换原有记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your saved file is unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你保存的文件未变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your saved game resumes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已恢复你保存的对局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your saved progress could not be backed up for this version of Checkmate, so it was not replaced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法为此版本的 Checkmate 备份已保存的进度，因此未替换原有进度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your saved progress was not changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你保存的进度未被更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your seat is kept for you, so practice help stays off until you review this game or go back to games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的对局席位仍被保留，因此练习辅助将保持关闭，直到你复盘本局或返回对局列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your side": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你执哪方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your side:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你执哪方："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your story starts with one move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的故事，从一步棋开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your turn": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轮到你了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your turn · Black": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轮到你了 · 白方以外的黑方"
          }
